OL,7,B] ADEADLY JOKE    A]CVRAAG 01          
OL,8,C"This man is Ernest Scribbler .. writer
OL,9,Cof jokes.In a few moments,he will have 
OL,10,Cwritten the funniest joke in the world 
OL,11,C... and as a consequence,he will die   
OL,12,C... laughing".                         
